s:517:"<p><strong>Non-Use of AI Acknowledgment and Agreement</strong></p>
<p><em>"I hereby acknowledge and agree that I will not utilize any artificial intelligence (AI) tools, including but not limited to automated content generation, language models, or AI-assisted software, in connection with [specific task, project, or service]. I understand that any violation of this agreement may result in disciplinary action, termination of access, or other appropriate measures as determined by [company/organization]."</em></p>";